+    // Height layouts (5.1.4 / 7.1.4 / 9.1.6) are at the end so the loop
+    // exits as soon as the driver rejects them on hardware that caps at
+    // 7.1, but lets pro multi-channel devices (e.g. MOTU 24Ao in WASAPI
